# M10 (b2): targets. Fury and Shatterskull Smashing (a division among targets, at trigger placement
# and as a spell is cast), Sink into Stupor (a
# spell or a permanent in one target).
category:DIVIDE_DAMAGE
row:divide_among_targets
row:divide_one_target
# Group rows: Unlicensed Hearse's one graveyard, Goblin Welder's pair, its Branch.
row:target_gate:same_controller
row:target_gate:defined_controller
row:target_gate:leaves_a_target
row:sharesControllerWith
effect:Branch
# ChangeTargets (Untimely Malfunction): a target changed as it resolves, through the same rows.
effect:ChangeTargets
row:target_gate:another_target
